{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41352","headline":"遇放猿再作 · 王仁裕","name":"遇放猿再作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嶓冢祠前汉水滨，饮猿连臂下嶙峋。\n渐来子细窥行客，认得依稀是野宾。\n月宿从劳羁絏梦，松餐非复稻粱身。\n数声肠断和云呌，识是前时旧主人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王仁裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41352.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41352","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}